    "text": "A primary aliphatic amine on reaction with nitrous acid in cold <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>273</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and there after raising temperature of reaction mixture to room temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, gives a/an",
